poechk bundles data files derived from Awakened PoE Trade
(https://github.com/SnosMe/awakened-poe-trade).

The files under data/poe1/ (stats.ndjson, items.ndjson) originate from that
project. Awakened PoE Trade derives them from Path of Exile game data via RePoE
(https://github.com/brather1ng/RePoE). Path of Exile is a trademark of Grinding
Gear Games; poechk is fan-made and not affiliated with or endorsed by GGG.

